          "description": "Use this when the customer has shown genuine interest (service, membership, or appointment intent) but `{customer_name}`, `{customer_email}`, or `{customer_phone}` are not yet fully collected. Collects all three contact fields one at a time, then immediately creates the lead record. This playbook does not recommend services or attempt bookings — it only captures contact information and hands off once complete.",
