          "description": "Use this when the customer has already confirmed service or membership interest (`{service_interest}` or `{package_interest}` is set) and is ready to book. Execution only — collects preferred date and time, confirms, and creates the appointment record. Does not re-recommend a service, does not re-qualify the customer, and does not reopen discovery. If interest is not yet confirmed, this playbook should not be active — route to Service Advisor or Membership Advisor first.",
