      "updatedByID": 2076840
    },
    {
      "id": "6a2d68644bf8dc7c0291e52f",
      "name": "Core Lead Capture - old",
      "createdByID": 2076840,
      "folderID": null,
      "settings": {},
      "description": "Use this to collect the customer's name, email, and phone number when they haven't been provided yet and are needed before the conversation can proceed or end.",
      "instructions": [
        {
          "text": [
            "Collect the customer's name, email, and phone number — whichever of ",
            {
              "variableID": "6a2c7b95a0c570b69f38d2b6"
            },
            " , ",
            {
              "variableID": "6a2c7ba2a0c570b69f38d2b7"
            },
            " , ",
            {
              "variableID": "6a2c7bd8a0c570b69f38d2b8"
            },
            "  are currently empty.\r\n\r\n1. Ask for missing details naturally, woven into conversation (e.g. \"Great, I can get that booked! Can I grab your name and email for the confirmation?\").\r\n2. Store the values in ",
            {
              "variableID": "6a2c7b95a0c570b69f38d2b6"
            },
            " , ",
            {
              "variableID": "6a2c7ba2a0c570b69f38d2b7"
            },
            " , ",
            {
              "variableID": "6a2c7bd8a0c570b69f38d2b8"
            },
            " .\r\n3. If the customer declines to share, do not push more than once — proceed without escalating.\r\n4. After capturing all details, call \"Create Lead\" API tool & pass  ",
            {
              "variableID": "6a2c7b95a0c570b69f38d2b6"
            },
            " , ",
            {
              "variableID": "6a2c7ba2a0c570b69f38d2b7"
            },
            " , ",
            {
              "variableID": "6a2c7bd8a0c570b69f38d2b8"
            },
            " ."
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": [
            "5. Once captured (or declined), return to the previous task.\r\n\r\nDone when: ",
            {
              "variableID": "6a2c7b95a0c570b69f38d2b6"
            },
            " , ",
            {
              "variableID": "6a2c7ba2a0c570b69f38d2b7"
            },
            " , and ",
            {
              "variableID": "6a2c7bd8a0c570b69f38d2b8"
            },
            "  are filled & tool called, or the customer has declined after one polite request."
          ]
        }
      ],
      "pathToolOrder": [],
      "webSearchTool": {
        "enabled": false,
        "messages": null,
        "toolSound": null,
