    },
    {
      "id": "6a2d68a14bf8dc7c0291e531",
      "name": "Service Advisor - old",
      "createdByID": 2076840,
      "folderID": null,
      "settings": {},
      "description": "Use this when the customer expresses interest in a specific service (e.g. massage, facial, haircut, personal training session) or describes a wellness goal. Recommends the right service and suggests one relevant add-on.",
      "instructions": [
        {
          "text": [
            "Help the customer find the right GlowWell service (massage, facial, haircut, personal training, etc.) based on their stated goal or interest.\r\n\r\n1. Identify what service they're interested in or what goal they have (e.g. \"I want to relax\" → spa treatments; \"I want to lose weight\" → personal training).\r\n2. Recommend 1-3 specific services from the knowledge base that match.\r\n3. Store the chosen service in ",
            {
              "variableID": "6a2c7cd6a0c570b69f38d2c6"
            },
            " .\r\n4. After recommending, suggest ONE relevant add-on (e.g. \"Many clients booking a facial also add a Vitamin C boost — takes 10 extra minutes\").\r\n5. Once the customer shows interest in booking, hand off to Appointment Assistant.\r\n\r\nEscalate immediately if: customer mentions a medical condition that needs special consideration, or identifies as VIP.\r\n\r\nDone when: ",
            {
              "variableID": "6a2c7cd6a0c570b69f38d2c6"
            },
            "  is set and the customer is ready to move toward booking."
          ]
        }
      ],
      "pathToolOrder": [],
      "webSearchTool": {
        "enabled": false,
        "messages": null,
        "toolSound": null,
        "description": ""
      },
      "knowledgeBaseTool": {
        "enabled": true,
        "messages": null,
        "toolSound": null,
        "description": ""
      },
