      "updatedByID": 2076840
    },
    {
      "id": "6a2d68d54bf8dc7c0291e538",
      "name": "Appointment Assistant - old",
      "createdByID": 2076840,
      "folderID": null,
      "settings": {},
      "description": "Use this once a service or package has been recommended and the customer is ready to book. Collects preferred date and time, confirms the appointment, and finalizes the booking. Do not use this for initial recommendations — only for finalizing a booking already discussed.",
      "instructions": [
        {
          "text": [
            "Finalize the booking once a service or package has been recommended and the customer is ready to book. Do not re-ask what service/package they want — that's already been decided.\r\n\r\n1. Ask for their preferred date and time. Collect these as two separate pieces of information.\r\n2. Store the date in ",
            {
              "variableID": "6a33095785fc579807311a15"
            },
            "  using format YYYY-MM-DD (e.g. 2026-06-20).\r\n3. Store the time in ",
            {
              "variableID": "6a33097485fc579807311a1a"
            },
            "  using 24-hour format HH:MM (e.g. 14:00).\r\n4. Also store a natural-language version in ",
            {
              "variableID": "6a2c7cf6a0c570b69f38d2c8"
            },
            "  for display purposes (e.g. \"Saturday at 2pm\").\r\n5. If ",
            {
              "variableID": "6a2c7b95a0c570b69f38d2b6"
            },
            " , ",
            {
              "variableID": "6a2c7ba2a0c570b69f38d2b7"
            },
            " , or",
            {
              "variableID": "6a2c7bd8a0c570b69f38d2b8"
            },
            " are missing, hand off to Core Lead Capture first.\r\n6. Once date/time and contact details are collected, call the \"Create Conversion\" API tool "
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": [
            "7. After succesfull API call, confirm the appointment back to the customer in a friendly summary (service/package + date/time).\r"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": [
            "\r\n\r\nDone when: ",
            {
              "variableID": "6a33095785fc579807311a15"
            },
            " , ",
            {
              "variableID": "6a33097485fc579807311a1a"
            },
            " , and ",
            {
              "variableID": "6a2c7cf6a0c570b69f38d2c8"
            },
            "  are all set, contact details are complete, \"Create Conversion\" API tool called succesfully & the customer has received a confirmation."
          ]
        }
      ],
      "pathToolOrder": [],
      "webSearchTool": {
        "enabled": false,
        "messages": null,
        "toolSound": null,
        "description": ""
      },
      "knowledgeBaseTool": {
        "enabled": true,
        "messages": null,
        "toolSound": null,
        "description": ""
      },
      "buttonTool": null,
      "cardTool": null,
      "carouselTool": null,
      "callForwardTool": null,
